Subject: [PATCH 15/43] feat(smap): use access_bit_actc_data for accumulated
 access frequency with decay

Replace the previous usage of page->flags for access tracking. Now
access_bit_actc_data records cumulative access frequency with aging/decay,
while page->flags is reserved solely to indicate whether a page is newly
allocated.
